questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput Spring Boot application encounters an `OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space` after running for several days. Memory dumps show millions of `OrderContext` objects accumulating in memory. You locate the following service component:

java
@Service
public class OrderProcessingService {
    private final Map<UUID, OrderContext> activeContexts = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    @Transactional
    public void processOrder(Order order) {
        OrderContext context = new OrderContext(order);
        activeContexts.put(order.getId(), context);

        paymentService.charge(order);
        inventoryService.reserve(order);

        activeContexts.remove(order.getId());
    }
}
